ction: 2030<br>Lee County State Attorney&rsquo;s Office<br>Lee County Justice Center [Complex] &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>2000 Main Street, 6th Floor &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>Fort Myers, FL &nbsp;33901 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>239-533-1000<br><br></span></p><h2 class="subhead1"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Superintendent of Schools</span></h2><p><span style="font-size: 18px;"><a data-fr-linked="true" href="http://www.leeschools.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-size: 18px;" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Lee County School District Website</a></span></p><p style="margin-left: 20px;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Denise Carlin</strong> (Republican)<br>Next Election: 2028<br>Lee County Schools<br>2855 Colonial Blvd.<br>Fort Myers, FL &nbsp;33966<br>239-334-1102</span></p><p style="margin-left: 20px;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><br></span></p><h2 class="subhead1"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Tax Collector</span></h2><p><span style="font-size: 18px;"><a data-fr-linked="true" href="https://leetc.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-size: 18px;" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Tax Collector Website</a></span></p><p style="margin-left: 20px;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Noelle Branning</strong> (Republican)<br>Next Election: 2028<br>Lee County Tax Collector<br>Melvin Morgan Constitutional Complex &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>2480 Thompson St 1st Floor &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>Fort Myers, FL &nbsp;33901 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nb