="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Armor Persons (Chair)</strong><br>Next Election: 2026</span><br><span style="font-size: 18px;"><br></span></p><h2 class="subhead1" id="isPasted"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">District 6 - At Large &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></h2><p style="margin-left: 20px;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Jada Langford-Fleming &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><br>Next Election: 2030</span><br><span style="font-size: 18px;"><br></span></p><h2 class="subhead1"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">District 7 - At Large &nbsp;</span></h2><p style="margin-left: 20px;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Vanessa Chaviano</strong><br>Next Election: 2028<br></span></p>
